          "settings": {
            "benefit_title": "Reach More Customers, Faster",
            "benefit_description": "Foot traffic and referrals are great, but limited. Customers now search online first. From local suburbs to nationwide, a solid online presence gets your business in front of people already looking for exactly what you offer. We help you appear where it counts; Google, Facebook, Instagram so you win more business, more often.",
